// Accept: assume { complete } establishes the fact at the fine key,
// demote propagates it to the coarser key (`demote_completeWrt`), and
// the reducing map_bags consumes it (ADR 0017 as amended by ADR 0023),
// bringing the bag back to singletons.  Dropping `ts` (not the promoted
// column) keeps this a genuine coarsening, not an ADR 0024 round trip.
unit Reading { ts: int }
store readings { unit { Reading } attr { machine: string } attr { credits: int } }
view rollup {
  readings |> promote machine
           |> assume { complete }
           |> demote ts
           |> map_bags |k, b| (.total = sum b.credits)
}
